Question : Darth Vader's famous reveal to Luke is iconic. But which of these is the right one?
Choix :
A. &quot;Luke, I am your father.&quot;
B. "No. I am your father."
C. &quot;The truth is that I am your father.&quot;
D. &quot;You&#039;re wrong. I am your father.&quot;

Réponds uniquement par la lettre correspondant à la bonne réponse. N'ajoute ni explication ni ponctuation.

Question : In the game "Overwatch," which quote does the hero "McCree" NOT say upon using his flashbang ability?
Choix :
A. &quot;Hold up now.&quot;
B. &quot;Don&#039;t move.&quot;
C. "You done?"
D. &quot;Whoa there.&quot;

Réponds uniquement par la lettre correspondant à la bonne réponse. N'ajoute ni explication ni ponctuation.

Question : The lesser-known continuation of the saying "Curiosity killed the cat..." is:
Choix :
A. &quot;...and the silent mouse remained thereat.&quot;
B. "...but satisfaction brought it back."
C. &quot;...which taught it not to do that.&quot;
D. &quot;...but death by the truth is better than ignorance.&quot;

Réponds uniquement par la lettre correspondant à la bonne réponse. N'ajoute ni explication ni ponctuation.

Question : In "Earthbound", how does one enter "Master Belch's" factory?
Choix :
A. Enter the password &quot;Fly Honey&quot;
B. Enter the password &quot;Master Belch Rules&quot;
C. Enter the password &quot;Mr Saturn Drools&quot;
D. Wait 3 Minutes

Réponds uniquement par la lettre correspondant à la bonne réponse. N'ajoute ni explication ni ponctuation.

Question : In HTML, which non-standard tag used to be be used to make elements scroll across the viewport?
Choix :
A. &lt;scroll&gt;&lt;/scroll&gt;
B. &lt;slide&gt;&lt;/slide&gt;
C. <marquee></marquee>
D. &lt;move&gt;&lt;/move&gt;

Réponds uniquement par la lettre correspondant à la bonne réponse. N'ajoute ni explication ni ponctuation.

Question : In the video game series "Disgaea", what word does the character Prinny have to include in all sentences they speak?
Choix :
A. &quot;Master&quot;
B. "Dood"
C. &quot;Plip&quot;
D. &quot;Boom&quot;

Réponds uniquement par la lettre correspondant à la bonne réponse. N'ajoute ni explication ni ponctuation.

Question : Which of these songs was released in 1996?
Choix :
A. David Bowie - &quot;1984&quot;
B. Prince - &quot;1999&quot;
C. James Blunt - &quot;1973&quot;
D. The Smashing Pumpkins - "1979"

Réponds uniquement par la lettre correspondant à la bonne réponse. N'ajoute ni explication ni ponctuation.

Question : Which of the following is NOT a quote from the 1942 film Casablanca?
Choix :
A. &ldquo;Of all the gin joints, in all the towns, in all the world, she walks into mine&hellip;&rdquo;
B. &quot;Here&#039;s lookin&#039; at you, kid.&quot;
C. &quot;Round up the usual suspects.&quot;
D. "Frankly, my dear, I don't give a damn."

Réponds uniquement par la lettre correspondant à la bonne réponse. N'ajoute ni explication ni ponctuation.

