A. &quot;And I liked the dimple in your chin / Your pale blue eyes&quot;
B. &quot;Fly away on, my zephyr / I feel it more than ever&quot;
C. "A rainy Lithuanian / Is dancing as an Indian"
D. &quot;You used to be so warm and affectionate...but now you&#039;re quick to get into your regret&quot;

Réponds uniquement par la lettre correspondant à la bonne réponse. N'ajoute ni explication ni ponctuation.

